#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.day_name:1
msgid "Return the day names with specified locale."
msgstr "返回指定区域设置的星期几名称。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.day_name.rst
