#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.day_name:3
msgid ""
"Locale determining the language in which to return the day name. Default "
"is English locale (``'en_US.utf8'``). Use the command ``locale -a`` on "
"your terminal on Unix systems to find your locale language code."
msgstr ""
"确定返回星期几名称的语言环境。默认为英语环境（``'en_US.utf8'``）。在Unix"
"系统上使用终端命令``locale -a`` 来查找您的语言环境代码。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.day_name.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.day_name:9
